OL,3,AIran retaliates after US strikes kill
OL,4,Afour at wedding party, state media
OL,5,Areports
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Central Command (Centcom) said US
OL,8,Fstrikes on Iran followed "recent
OL,9,Fattempted attacks" by the Islamic
OL,10,FRevolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC)
OL,11,Fagainst commercial shipping in the
OL,12,FStrait of Hormuz.
